@startuml task_read_counters
!pragma layout smetana
title Typed tasks: read_counters / folder_projection
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

database "Recorded events outbox\nfanout/read/hide/move/delete" as OUTBOX
participant "Task projector" as PROJECTOR
database "Immutable tasks\n1 I 'm on outbox event/scope" as TASKS
database "Rented exact scope key\nlease + fencing" as CLAIM
participant "The worker's slot." as WORKER
database "The facts of the message + read_at\nAccess + policy" as SOURCE
database "Active USER_STREAM_BINDING\n+ STREAM.is_archived/private" as STREAM_SOURCE
database "FOLDER + normalized FOLDER_ITEM\nsource of truth" as FOLDERS
database "USER_STREAM_BINDING" as STREAM_BINDING
database "USER_TOPIC_BINDING" as TOPIC_BINDING
database "USER_FOLDER_BINDING" as FOLDER_BINDING
database "The public events repository" as EVENTS
participant "The controller . WebSocket" as DISPATCHER
actor "The client ." as Client

OUTBOX -> PROJECTOR : The impact of the events that have been recorded
PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable folder_projection for the folder\nuser-folder scope; unique derivation; without coalescing
TASKS -> WORKER : Clearly affected areas
WORKER -> CLAIM : Monopoly user-stream / user-topic / user-folder
WORKER -> SOURCE : Read the last state of the original
WORKER -> STREAM_SOURCE : Read the active link + canonical STREAM
WORKER -> STREAM_BINDING : I'm ready to count.
WORKER -> TOPIC_BINDING : We 're going to have a lot of potential topic counters .
group One . worker DB transaction
  WORKER -> FOLDERS : We can add/delete automatic FOLDER_ITEM
  WORKER -> FOLDER_BINDING : deterministic folder_items_snapshot + counts\nversion/snapshot_updated_at; empty=[]
  WORKER -> EVENTS : ready stream.updated / topic.updated / folder.updated\nand folder_item.deleted, When it 's announced contract operation\nunique derivation/effect key
end
WORKER -> CLAIM : I 'm going to get out .
EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : Only after commit: - I 'm not sure .
DISPATCHER -> Client : Send / repeat / play

note over SOURCE,FOLDER_BINDING
  Container aggregates are not stored in message binding/state.
  USER_FOLDER_BINDING keeps access, personal status
  and ready units + read-only folder_items_snapshot.
  Public folder_items It 's showing exactly snapshot; empty=[].
  API He 's reading one . indexed row/page, without N+1/json_agg/COUNT/custom SQL.
  Correction / rearrangement is only done in the background.
  Topic-worker He doesn't write these. shared rows.
  Atomic delta It requires exactly-once effect guard The outbox_event_uuid;
  Otherwise scope worker recomputes/writes.
  Lifecycle: lease expiry/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper.
end note

note over STREAM_SOURCE,FOLDERS
  The predicate: active USER_STREAM_BINDING + STREAM.is_archived=false.
  All chats = All these lines..
  Personal = I 'm just STREAM.private=true.
  Channels = I 'm just STREAM.private=false.
  The client query doesn 't calculate this composition ..
  Stable order: pinned_at DESC first; then
  order_index ASC NULLS LAST, created_at ASC, uuid ASC.
  No silent truncation; exact count/byte hard limits remain required.
end note

@enduml
